      "analysis": "{\"objectType\":\"heavy assault breach truck\",\"objectClass\":\"hard-surface\",\"complexity\":\"complex\",\"identityFeatures\":[\"row of angled steel breach spikes/blades on the front\",\"six oversized wheels in two tri-axle groups with glowing red hub rings\",\"boxy armored cab with slitted visor windows and roof-mounted light bar\",\"brass/gold-and-olive weathered armor plating with hazard stripes\",\"riveted access panel with warning triangle decal on the flank\",\"chunky angular grille/hood block between cab and breach assembly\"],\"camera\":{\"azimuthDeg\":-35,\"elevationDeg\":20,\"note\":\"front-left three-quarter isometric view, slightly above eye level\"},\"partPlan\":[{\"part\":\"cab / crew compartment\",\"approach\":\"boxy\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.3,\"top\":0.1,\"width\":0.3,\"height\":0.28},\"primitives\":\"roundedBox for the main cab shell with a beveled top edge to match the angular armored roofline\",\"details\":\"slit visor windows inset as flat dark panels, roof light bar as small glow strips, hazard-striped edge trim\"},{\"part\":\"roof light bar\",\"approach\":\"boxy\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.33,\"top\":0.06,\"width\":0.2,\"height\":0.05},\"primitives\":\"row of small boxes/capsules for light pods with glow sprites\",\"details\":\"linear repeat of 4-5 small emissive rectangular lights, pale cyan-white glow\"},{\"part\":\"hood / grille block\",\"approach\":\"boxy\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.45,\"top\":0.2,\"width\":0.2,\"height\":0.2},\"primitives\":\"box with louver finish for the grille face, chamfered front edge\",\"details\":\"horizontal louver slats, warning-triangle decal, small pipe cylinders along the side\"},{\"part\":\"front breach spike assembly\",\"approach\":\"freeform-mesh\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.2,\"top\":0.3,\"width\":0.28,\"height\":0.2},\"primitives\":\"row of elongated cones/prisms angled downward-forward to form interlocking mole-blade teeth\",\"details\":\"linear radial repeat of 6-8 tapered blades, worn brushed-metal finish with dark rust streaks at tips, mounted on a riveted gold backing plate\"},{\"part\":\"side armor hull / bed\",\"approach\":\"boxy\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.4,\"top\":0.2,\"width\":0.4,\"height\":0.35},\"primitives\":\"long roundedBox forming the chassis body linking cab to rear, with beveled panel insets\",\"details\":\"riveted access panels, 'SECTOR 07' and 'ACCESS PANEL' textDecals, hazard-stripe trim along lower edge, worn/patina finish over olive-gold base\"},{\"part\":\"wheel wells / fenders\",\"approach\":\"rounded-shell\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.35,\"top\":0.45,\"width\":0.45,\"height\":0.15},\"primitives\":\"flattened arch shapes flush over each wheel pair to suggest armored fender skirting\",\"details\":\"brushed metal finish, small rivet rows along the arch edge\"},{\"part\":\"wheels (6, two tri-axle groups)\",\"approach\":\"revolved\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.3,\"top\":0.45,\"width\":0.55,\"height\":0.35},\"primitives\":\"cylinder tire body with lathe-profiled rim and torus glow ring for the hub\",\"details\":\"radial repeat of tread knurl pattern, glowing red torus/disc hub with dark center, six wheels arranged 3 per side (front, mid, rear)\"},{\"part\":\"chassis undercarriage\",\"approach\":\"boxy\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.3,\"top\":0.55,\"width\":0.55,\"height\":0.1},\"primitives\":\"long low box/tube frame connecting axles beneath the hull\",\"details\":\"dark worn-metal finish, mostly hidden but keeps wheel spacing correct\"},{\"part\":\"side pipes / exhaust stacks\",\"approach\":\"boxy\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.42,\"top\":0.28,\"width\":0.06,\"height\":0.15},\"primitives\":\"cylinder pipes running along the hood/cab seam\",\"details\":\"pair of vertical exhaust cylinders with rusty brushed finish, small flange rings\"},{\"part\":\"rear body block\",\"approach\":\"boxy\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.62,\"top\":0.15,\"width\":0.2,\"height\":0.3},\"primitives\":\"roundedBox forming the tapered rear cargo/engine compartment\",\"details\":\"vertical vent slits (louver finish), green-teal panel tint distinct from front gold, small warning decal\"},{\"part\":\"emblem / star badge\",\"approach\":\"wrap-decal\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.35,\"top\":0.2,\"width\":0.05,\"height\":0.05},\"primitives\":\"flat-cutout star shape as textDecal on cab side\",\"details\":\"single white star insignia decal on front cab flank\"}],\"attachments\":[\"cab centered-above hood / grille block\",\"roof light bar flush-top cab\",\"hood / grille block attached-front side armor hull\",\"front breach spike assembly attached-front hood / grille block\",\"side armor hull / bed attached-back cab\",\"rear body block attached-back side armor hull / bed\",\"wheel wells / fenders attached-front-and-rear side armor hull / bed\",\"wheels (6) inset-into wheel wells / fenders\",\"chassis undercarriage rests-on wheels\",\"side pipes / exhaust stacks attached-left hood / grille block\",\"emblem / star badge inset-into cab\"],\"buildRecipe\":[\"Overall proportions from spec: length 8.4m, width 3.6m, height 3.9m — build the hull long and low with a tall boxy cab, wheels occupying the lower 40% of height.\",\"Cab sits forward-center, roughly cube-shaped with a beveled/angled roof front edge; keep window slits thin and dark, not full glass panes.\",\"Front breach assembly is the key identity feature: 6-8 tapered angled blades fanned forward-down from a riveted gold plate mounted low on the front bumper, angled ~30-40deg forward like a mole's teeth.\",\"Six wheels arranged as two tri-axle rows (3 left, 3 right), evenly spaced along the mid-to-rear hull length; each wheel gets a glowing red torus/ring inset in the hub center against a dark rim.\",\"Body color: dark olive-brass/gold armor plating (NOT bright gold — sample the flatter orthographic panel, which reads as muted brass-olive with dark bronze trim), rear compartment panels shift toward a desaturated teal-green.\",\"Apply worn/brushed metal finish across all armor panels with rust/patina streaks concentrated near the spike assembly and lower fenders.\",\"Hazard stripe trim (black/yellow diagonal) runs along lower hull edge and select panel borders; keep it sparse, only 2-3 stripe runs, not full wrap.\",\"Add riveted access panel decals with small warning-triangle icon and stenciled labels ('SECTOR 07', 'ACCESS PANEL', 'NO ENTRY') on the cab and side hull as textDecals, oriented flat on panel faces.\",\"Roof light bar: small row of 4-5 rectangular light pods with soft white-cyan glow sprites, centered along the cab roof ridge.\",\"Exhaust/pipe cylinders run vertically along the cab-hood seam on both sides, rust-brushed finish, thin flange rings at top and base.\",\"Fenders/wheel wells are flattened arch shapes bridging front and rear wheel groups, riveted along their rim to tie the armor plating visually to the wheels.\",\"Keep the whole silhouette blocky and aggressive — no smooth curves except tire treads and hub rings; corners should be hard-chamfered rather than fully rounded.\"]}",
